-- Calls on the victim's business (LA) that every caller who is not a member of LA must be refused (K-42, G-17).
-- Included by rls_functions.sql (as a signed-in stranger) and sec1_tenant_matrix.sql (Sec 1: as the owner, manager
-- and staff of the other business LB, and as Kabsi staff), after tests.act_as(...). Not a test file: pg_prove runs
-- *.sql only. Expects the fixtures of _fixtures.psql plus the victim fact ..fd that rls_functions.sql inserts.
select throws_ok($$ select public.add_photo('00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000c1', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000c1/victim.jpg') $$, '42501', null, 'add_photo refuses a non-member');
